{"id":"gastfreundschaft","lemma":"Gastfreundschaft","pos":"noun","rank":4980,"glosses":["hospitality"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bb/De-Gastfreundschaft.ogg/De-Gastfreundschaft.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Gastfreundschaft","plural":"Gastfreundschaften"},"examples":[{"text":"Danke für eure Gastfreundschaft.","en":"Thank you for your hospitality.","words":[{"g":"thanks, thank you"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"your","l":"euer"},null]},{"text":"Vielen Dank für Ihre Gastfreundschaft.","en":"Thank you very much for your hospitality.","words":[null,null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"thank you very much"]]},{"text":"Ich danke Ihnen für Ihre Gastfreundschaft!","en":"Thank you for your hospitality.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"thanks, thank you"},{"g":"(to) them","l":"sie"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null]},{"text":"Ich dankte ihr für ihre herzliche Gastfreundschaft.","en":"I thanked her for her kind hospitality.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to thank","l":"danken"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},{"g":"warm","l":"herzlich"},null]},{"text":"Sie nutzte unsere Gastfreundschaft aus und blieb einen ganzen Monat, ohne uns irgendwas zu zahlen.","en":"She took advantage of our hospitality and stayed a whole month without paying us anything.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"benefit","l":"Nutzen"},{"g":"our","l":"unser"},null,{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"to remain","l":"bleiben"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"entire","l":"ganz"},{"g":"month"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to pay"}]}]}